{"id": "68319", "title": "坏女人也可以穿越之情罪", "author": "喜也悲", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 18, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68319.htm", "intro": "是不是得不到的才是最好的？又是不是所有的真心付出都会有回报的一天？当刀一次次刺入我的胸口，当泪眼模糊中对着他的脸时我又是以着什么样的心情来面对这一切的？\r\n做尽了坏事的我死是迟早的事情，可是怎么也没有想到这样的我竟还能穿越重生，而最让我觉得可笑的是，前生拼尽了所有去争取的东西最后落的一场空，今生怕了、躲了、放下了却因情缠身而挣脱不开，老天我到底错在了哪里你要这样捉弄我！！\r\n什么得到失去由命，缘来缘去随天，放屁！我的命运我做主！！！", "base": "files/article/html/68/68319", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10525066.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10525067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10525068.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10525069.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10525070.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10525071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10525072.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10525073.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10525074.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10525075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10525076.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10525077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "10525078.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "10525079.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "10525080.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "10525081.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "10525082.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10525083.html", "available": false}]}